# LF everywhere, on every platform. Some files are used byte for byte on
# Linux (udev rules, device-package scripts, shell scripts), and a Windows
# checkout with CRLF would break them and the tests that compare them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.bin binary
*.upd binary
*.sig binary
*.img binary
*.xz binary
*.zst binary
*.woff2 binary
